      647.41,
      286.84,
      722.03
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land : Kammalgoda Watta Henayaya, Kalugalabadda and Lalugahahena; Description of the Land : Garden, 20-25 year old cinaman plantation, A 15-20 year old tea and cinaman plantation, 60 Attonia trees 10 to 20 years old, two mango trees, two mahogany trees, five",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
