    "text": "coconut trees, two mango trees 20 to 30 years old, two Jack trees, 30 Wild worm wood trees, two jack trees 30 to 40 years old; Original Claimants : Abeysirinarayana Wanigarathna Nandasiri and Others; Extent : 1.6187 Hectares.",
