      541.53
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Mulatiyana on 24th of February 2025 at 10.00 a.m.",
