      541.07,
      544.67,
      615.71
    ],
    "text": "And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 14th of December 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for computation for the acquisition of the said lands/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
